# === WE SKIN — keep internal docs & local junk out of the public repo / Vercel deploy ===

# Internal business documents (proposals, meeting notes, pilot tracker, case studies …).
# They all follow the WE-SKIN-* naming convention — keep the public Build Log, block the rest.
WE-SKIN-*
!WE-SKIN-Build-Log.md

# Office formats are never web-deploy assets — block any that slip in under a different name
*.docx
*.pptx
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pages
*.key
*.numbers

# Office / editor lock & temp files
.~lock.*#
~$*
*.tmp

# Internal agent notes
AGENTS.md

# Stale design variants (superseded by index.html)
we-skin*.html

# Stray source image not used by the site
WeSkin.jpeg

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
